{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54891","headline":"兵要望江南 占水族第二十一（京本列第十二○七首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占水族第二十一（京本列第十二○七首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营内，鱼鼈现（辛本、川本、京本作「鼈忽露」）其形。\n防有内奸谋叛逆，不然水涨浸军兵，速去得安宁。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54891.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54891","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}